OL,3,GNEWSABotched extension left family at
OL,4,Afatal risk - HSE
OL,5,
OL,6,FA construction firm has been fined
OL,7,Fnearly #15,000 after a botched
OL,8,Fextension put the lives of a homeowner
OL,9,Fand her two children at risk.
OL,11,FAdam's Building Construction Ltd and
OL,12,Fits director Mohammed Adam Azhar were
OL,13,Fsentenced at Leeds Magistrates' Court
OL,14,Fon 7 August after the extension on a
OL,15,Fhome in Bradford was found to be
OL,16,F"immediately dangerous", according to
OL,17,Fthe Health and Safety Executive (HSE).
OL,19,FThe firm built an extension over gas
OL,20,Fpipework and a boiler flue without
OL,21,Fmoving them, despite repeated warnings,
OL,22,Fthe HSE said.
OL,23,APub: 18-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
