OL,3,GNEWSABotched extension left family at
OL,4,Afatal risk - HSE
OL,5,
OL,6,FHSE inspector David Beaton said it
OL,7,Fexposed the family to the risk of gas
OL,8,Fleaks, fire, explosion and carbon
OL,9,Fmonoxide poisoning, and was a "tragic
OL,10,Faccident waiting to happen".
